{
  "id": "alg7-c3-s3-n28",
  "card_id": "alg7-c3-s3-n28",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": null,
  "number": "28",
  "title": "近似数的乘除",
  "printed_title": "28. 近似数的乘除",
  "start_page": 179,
  "start_printed": 173,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "fig-37",
      "label": "图 37",
      "page": 183
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 21,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了叙述在实际计算中用到的近似数的乘法法则，我们需要有效数字的概念.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在一个数中，除了第一个不为零的数字之前的零以外，所有的可靠数字都叫做有效数字.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，设$x\\approx284$，$y\\approx0.342$，$z\\approx0.005070$（其中每个数的所有数字都是可靠数字）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在近似数$x$中，所有数字都是有效数字.在近似数$y$中，有三个有效数字：$3$，$4$，$2$.在近似数$z$中，第三个零以后的数字$5$，$0$，$7$，$0$是有效数字.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来看一个例子.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设$x=28.4\\pm0.04$，$y=0.75\\pm0.005$.不难理解，近似数$x$与$y$所取的全都是可靠数字.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "作为积$xy$的近似数，我们取这两个数的近似数的和：$28.4\\times0.75=21.300$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在所得到的积中，哪些数字是可靠数字呢？为了说明这一点，我们应用界限法.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$28.36\\leqslant x\\leqslant28.44$，$0.745\\leqslant y\\leqslant0.755$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$21.1282\\leqslant xy\\leqslant21.4722$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "有：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$|xy-21.300|\\leqslant|21.4722-21.1282|\\leqslant0.5$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 173,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0179#15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这就是说，在$21.300$中右起第一个可靠数字是个位数字$1$，也就是说，在写出的积的近似数中有两个可靠数字.这两个数字也是有效数字.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们在积的近似数中得到了两个有效数字，也就是与有效数字个数最少的因数$0.75$中的有效数字个数相同.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们从另外一些例子会注意到，近似数的积的有效数字个数，与有效数字个数最少的因数相同，或者比它少一个.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，在实际计算中，通常应用下述法则：近似数相乘时，有效数字个数最少的因数有几个有效数字，它们的积就保留几个数字（不算前边的零）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "注意，如果一个因数的值是准确的，另一个因数的值是近似的，那么积的近似数中应该保留的数字个数（不算第一个零），与已知近似数的有效数字个数相同.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "实际上，这样的两个数相乘时，所得结果全部都是可靠数字（末位数有可能除外）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "很明显，为了避免多余的计算，可以把有效数字过多的因数先适当地四舍五入.四舍五入时保留的有效数字的个数，与有效数字个数最少的因数相同，但是要多保留一个备用数字.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1 已知$u\\approx0.4267$，$v\\approx0.73$，（在写出的近似数中，所有数字都是可靠数字），求$u$与$v$的积.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1. 找出有效数字个数最少的因数.这样的因数是$0.73$（两个有效数字）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2. 把因数$0.4267$四舍五入，使它比有效数字个数最少的因数多一个有效数字：$0.4267\\approx0.427$（四舍五入取到三个有效数字；一个数字是备用数字）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 174,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0180#10",
        "p0181#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "3. 相乘后得到积：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$0.427\\times0.73=0.31171$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "4. 把这个结果四舍五入，使其数字个数（不算第一个零）与有效数字个数最少的因数含有的有效数字个数相同：$0.31171\\approx0.31$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是，$uv\\approx0.31$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在计算近似数的商时，可以应用类似的法则.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2 设$x\\approx0.823$，$y\\approx1.34$（在写出的近似数中，所有数字都是可靠数字），计算式$\\frac{xy}{x+y}$的值，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1. 求出积$xy$的近似值：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$xy\\approx0.823\\times1.34=1.10282\\approx1.103$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "（在$x$与$y$的近似值中，都有三个有效数字.所得结果保留四个数字；有一个数字是备用数字.）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2. 求出和$x+y$的近似值：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x+y\\approx0.823+1.34=2.163$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "（$y$的近似数中，小数点后有两位；$x$的近似数中，小数点后有三位.所得结果保留到小数点后三位；有一个数字是备用数字.）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "3. 求出商$\\frac{xy}{x+y}$的近似值：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{xy}{x+y}\\approx\\frac{1.103}{2.163}\\approx0.5099$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "（不算备用数字，在分子与分母的近似值中，都含有三个有效数字. 计算结果，不算整数位上的零，共有四个数字；有一个数字是备用数字.）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0181#16",
        "p0182#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "4. 把上述结果四舍五入到三个数字（不算整数位上的零）：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0182#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{xy}{x+y}\\approx0.510$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0182#3"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
